    <statement><p>Give a vector parametric equation for the line
through the point <m>\left(2,-4\right)</m> that is perpendicular
to the line <m>\left\lt -2,3-t\right&gt;</m>:
<CENTER/></p>
<p><m>L(t)</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.
</p>
</statement>
